  {
    "access": "write",
    "description": "Propose a Time Entry: service time already done, on a day up to today (a day of the month alone, like "the 3rd", is the latest one up to today). Not for future days (plans_create). newCategory: a new Category the User names (a way of witnessing is a note). When the context shows showsTimeEntry false, send minutes 0 to mark that the User shared this month.",
