  },
  {
    "access": "write",
    "description": "Propose a new Day Plan: time the User intends to spend in service on a day, even one that already has a Plan; not for time already done. Send anytime true with startMinutes null, or anytime false with startMinutes; newCategory is a new Category the User names. repeats: the User wants it every week or day. withBuddies: buddies going along (not invited; the card says how).",
